msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The men are still holding Sarah down, another man is now shouting commands at them. Confusion."
msgstr "Die Männer halten Sarah immer noch fest, und ein weiterer Mann schreit ihnen nun Befehle zu. Verwirrung."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah can't understand the language. The only word she recognizes, repeated over and over, Hassar."
