msgid "Marion was now crawling away from her, trying to recover and get back on his feet."
msgstr "Als Marion wieder auf die Beine gekommen war, sah Sarah, dass sein Gesicht knallrot geworden war."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "By the time he had gotten onto his feet, Sarah could see his face had turned bright red."
msgstr "Als er wieder auf den Beinen war, konnte Sarah sehen, dass sein Gesicht leuchtend rot geworden war."

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I brought it up with Thomas...he thought it would be..."
msgstr "Ich habe das mit Thomas besprochen... er dachte, das wäre ein Witz..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
