msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah laid on her bed...hours passing before she dared to move again."
msgstr "Sarah lag auf ihrem Bett... Stunden vergingen, bevor sie es wieder wagte, sich zu bewegen."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The pain in her ass finally faded. Not by much, but enough that she dared to move."
