msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He handed her the money."
msgstr "Er reichte ihr das Geld."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Ooh, and now that I have you, you're also going to have to work the night shift in the main hall."
msgstr "Oh, und jetzt, wo ich dich hier habe, musst du auch noch die Nachtschicht in der Haupthalle arbeiten."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "The night shift? I already worked all day."
msgstr "Die Nachtschicht? Ich habe doch schon den ganzen Tag gearbeitet."

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Nothing to be done about it. All staff has been called on duty for the masquerade."
