msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time had passed, Lady Carolyn suddenly offered up a question that caught Sarah by surprise."
msgstr "Nach einer Weile stellte Lady Carolyn plötzlich eine Frage, die Sarah überraschte."

