msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's nice of you to say, but you're going to have to do better than flattery if you want to repay me."
msgstr "Das ist nett von dir, aber du wirst mehr als nur Schmeicheleien leisten müssen, wenn du mich entschädigen willst."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw an exhausted, yet eager smile, creep over Samayra's face."
