msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I spend my life running away from it, and now I've walked back into it."
msgstr "Ich habe mein ganzes Leben lang vor diesem Ort geflohen, und jetzt bin ich einfach wieder hier gelandet."

msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I thought this place meant nothing to me, but now that I'm seeing the fields again...the memories of growing up here..."
