msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Instead, Kate kept her firmly in place with one hand, as her other remained between Sarah's legs."
msgstr "Stattdessen hielt Kate sie mit einer Hand fest an Ort und Stelle, während ihre andere zwischen Sarahs Beinen blieb."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was too skilled, and so Sarah did not even attempt to resist her cries of pleasure."
