msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You've had it before, huh? Always knew you were a fancy girl."
msgstr "Du hattest das schon mal, was? Ich wusste doch, dass du eine feine Dame bist."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
